WEBVTT

01:18.620 --> 01:21.750
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.890 --> 01:24.800
[Episode 10]

01:40.590 --> 01:41.120
Qian Fei.

01:41.280 --> 01:42.000
Director Fang.

01:42.000 --> 01:43.750
The materials you brought back
from Chengdu are very important.

01:43.750 --> 01:46.080
They affect
our cooperation with Shan Li Fang.

01:46.080 --> 01:47.900
But you might not
grasp the stakes right now.

01:47.900 --> 01:49.920
So today, learn more, observe more,
say less,

01:49.920 --> 01:50.560
and ideally, say nothing.

01:50.560 --> 01:51.060
Boss.

01:51.390 --> 01:53.590
-Okay, I see.
-Are we just going to forget about

01:53.590 --> 01:55.000
-the Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's
-Director Fang.

01:55.000 --> 01:56.120
falsified data from before?

01:56.120 --> 01:58.630
-I'm so happy to see you.
-Thank you for your patience.

01:58.630 --> 01:59.560
Sorry to keep you waiting.

01:59.560 --> 02:00.030
Not at all.

02:00.030 --> 02:01.560
I'm very happy you're here.

02:01.750 --> 02:02.510
-Mr. Wu?
-Please.

02:02.510 --> 02:02.960
Mr. Li?

02:03.680 --> 02:04.680
Director Fang.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.590
Come, welcome.

02:07.720 --> 02:08.470
Please.

02:08.630 --> 02:09.000
Come.

02:11.720 --> 02:12.590
Come.

02:12.660 --> 02:18.440
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

02:13.340 --> 02:14.450
Welcome.

02:14.840 --> 02:16.070
We've been looking forward to seeing you.

02:16.070 --> 02:17.180
This way, please.

02:19.000 --> 02:19.880
Mr. Li.

02:20.350 --> 02:21.480
This is your office.

02:22.070 --> 02:22.750
Not bad.

02:23.280 --> 02:24.610
Come, this way, please.

02:24.630 --> 02:26.230
This is the conference room.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.120
The pantry.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.240
Director Fang.

02:29.240 --> 02:29.840
Not bad.

02:30.430 --> 02:31.560
Your office is here.

02:32.510 --> 02:33.840
It's grander than mine.

02:34.160 --> 02:35.400
How is it? Take a look.

02:36.000 --> 02:38.280
This is the independent office area

02:38.280 --> 02:39.790
we set up for the joint sponsor team.

02:39.790 --> 02:41.120
If you have any other needs,

02:41.120 --> 02:42.050
just let us know.

02:42.190 --> 02:44.800
We will do whatever it takes

02:44.960 --> 02:46.560
to meet your needs on the battlefield.

02:46.560 --> 02:48.470
Before Shan Li Fang Hotel Group
goes to the review meeting,

02:48.470 --> 02:50.890
it's a test for all of us.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.960
Be well prepared, stay calm,

02:52.960 --> 02:54.030
and handle it professionally—

02:54.030 --> 02:55.350
there will be no problem.

02:55.350 --> 02:58.610
The professional abilities
of both of you are undeniable.

02:58.829 --> 03:01.110
You are both benchmarks in the industry.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.070
Therefore,

03:02.190 --> 03:04.030
we'll follow your lead.

03:05.720 --> 03:07.350
As for work-related matters,

03:07.350 --> 03:08.540
once you move in,

03:08.680 --> 03:09.880
we can coordinate them step by step.

03:09.880 --> 03:10.430
Okay.

03:10.910 --> 03:12.510
It's getting late.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.410
Let's go to the banquet hall for a meal.

03:14.410 --> 03:16.560
-Let's talk while eating, alright? Let's go.
-Okay.

03:16.560 --> 03:17.250
After you.

03:17.470 --> 03:17.910
Come.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.190
Not bad.

03:20.470 --> 03:21.160
Right?

03:24.880 --> 03:26.280
Everyone is here.

03:26.750 --> 03:28.210
On behalf of the group,

03:28.360 --> 03:30.480
I welcome you all to Shan Li Fang.

03:31.070 --> 03:32.329
Shan Li Fang's listing

03:32.350 --> 03:34.820
will rely on your full cooperation.

03:35.630 --> 03:36.690
Let me make a toast.

03:40.750 --> 03:41.750
After this drink,

03:42.000 --> 03:43.800
we will be fighting side by side.

03:44.680 --> 03:46.720
Although Mr. Wu is very hospitable,

03:46.790 --> 03:48.840
we still have an important meeting
after the meal.

03:48.840 --> 03:50.570
So please don't drink too much.

03:51.840 --> 03:52.840
I wish us success.

04:00.630 --> 04:02.880
Chairman Liao won't attend
the meeting this afternoon.

04:02.880 --> 04:04.740
Vice President Liao will attend.

04:05.680 --> 04:06.800
Chairman Liao isn't coming?

04:06.800 --> 04:08.150
He has an emergency

04:08.270 --> 04:10.920
and asked Vice President Liao
to attend on his behalf.

04:10.920 --> 04:14.250
I heard Vice President Liao
is young and beautiful,

04:15.040 --> 04:16.750
and she's also very capable.
Is that right?

04:16.750 --> 04:17.740
Yes.

04:18.040 --> 04:21.040
Vice President Liao is just as hardworking

04:21.120 --> 04:23.250
as Chairman Liao was when he was young.

04:27.150 --> 04:28.950
Sorry I'm late.

04:32.409 --> 04:35.210
Vice President Liao,
I'm so glad you could make it.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.510
Let me introduce you.

04:36.510 --> 04:39.000
This is Vice President Liao

04:39.040 --> 04:40.070
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

04:40.070 --> 04:40.840
Hello.

04:41.040 --> 04:41.840
And this is...

04:42.270 --> 04:44.000
Wu, is there any need for an introduction?

04:44.000 --> 04:45.510
Director Fang from He Jing Securities—

04:45.510 --> 04:47.370
who in Shanghai doesn't know her?

04:48.600 --> 04:49.470
You flatter me.

04:49.710 --> 04:50.930
Seeing you today,

04:51.180 --> 04:53.980
you're even younger and prettier
than I imagined.

04:56.040 --> 04:56.940
And this is...

04:57.630 --> 04:58.390
Mr. Li.

04:58.750 --> 04:59.510
Vice President Liao.

04:59.510 --> 05:00.940
My father often praises you,

05:00.940 --> 05:02.440
telling me to learn from you.

05:02.440 --> 05:04.000
Now I finally have the chance.

05:04.000 --> 05:05.310
You're too polite, Vice President Liao.

05:05.310 --> 05:07.360
Zhizhong Investment is here to serve.

05:07.360 --> 05:09.490
I hope we have a pleasant cooperation.

05:09.830 --> 05:10.630
Absolutely.

05:12.030 --> 05:13.760
The person who will be liaising with you

05:13.760 --> 05:15.630
is our group's CFO,

05:15.630 --> 05:16.670
Mr. Wang Ruohai.

05:17.000 --> 05:19.390
He will be in charge of coordinating

05:19.390 --> 05:20.990
with the joint sponsor team.

05:24.000 --> 05:24.680
Hello.

05:27.360 --> 05:28.500
Hello.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.270
Nice to meet you.

05:30.270 --> 05:31.400
Nice to meet you too.

05:31.930 --> 05:34.330
I'll be relying on your support
from now on.

05:35.510 --> 05:37.240
Don't just stand there.
Please take a seat.

05:37.240 --> 05:37.600
Okay.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.060
We are a family from now on.

05:44.070 --> 05:44.790
Ruohai.

05:45.120 --> 05:47.150
This silver cod
with black truffle and lily bulb

05:47.150 --> 05:49.070
is a new dish
developed by the Chinese kitchen.

05:49.070 --> 05:50.040
I heard the silver cod

05:50.040 --> 05:51.630
was just flown in today.

05:51.630 --> 05:53.070
I can't eat seafood today.

05:53.070 --> 05:53.950
Try it for me.

05:59.440 --> 06:00.640
Here, Director Fang.

06:00.710 --> 06:01.510
A toast to you.

06:02.040 --> 06:02.950
I was just about to toast you.

06:02.950 --> 06:03.410
Cheers.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.390
Here's to our cooperation.

06:05.390 --> 06:06.920
Here's to our cooperation.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.530
Director Wang,

06:08.880 --> 06:10.190
a toast to you two.

06:10.630 --> 06:12.600
Hope our project goes well.

06:12.600 --> 06:14.000
And please give us your guidance
in the future.

06:14.000 --> 06:14.750
Definitely.

06:15.480 --> 06:15.950
Here.

06:16.000 --> 06:16.650
Come on.

06:16.920 --> 06:17.850
Vice President.

06:17.920 --> 06:20.180
Drink less. We have work this afternoon.

06:23.070 --> 06:23.850
Thank you.

06:24.800 --> 06:25.480
A toast to you.

06:25.480 --> 06:26.360
To our successful cooperation.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.160
To our successful cooperation.

06:28.270 --> 06:29.470
Thank you, thank you.

06:35.240 --> 06:35.870
Qian Fei.

06:36.680 --> 06:38.800
Director Wang is sitting opposite you.

06:38.800 --> 06:39.920
We will have to

06:39.920 --> 06:41.420
deal with him a lot in our future work.

06:41.420 --> 06:42.460
Later,

06:42.560 --> 06:43.960
go and offer him a toast.

06:57.320 --> 06:58.380
[Don't go if you don't want to.]

07:02.440 --> 07:03.530
Ms. Liao, here.

07:03.710 --> 07:05.070
I must offer you a toast.

07:05.880 --> 07:06.800
It's our first time meeting.

07:06.800 --> 07:07.770
A toast to you.

07:07.250 --> 07:11.230
[So you already knew it.]

07:16.270 --> 07:16.920
You are...

07:17.310 --> 07:19.040
Yes, it's not convenient for me
to drink today.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.340
That's fine.

07:20.440 --> 07:22.680
I hope we can work together more
in the future.

07:22.680 --> 07:25.410
Director Wang,
I'd like to propose a toast to you.

07:27.680 --> 07:30.480
I wish you success in your career,
a bright future,

07:33.390 --> 07:34.320
and a happy life.

07:35.190 --> 07:37.540
I'll finish it in one go.
You can drink as you please.

07:37.540 --> 07:39.000
Let's all drink as we plea—

07:46.050 --> 07:48.380
Okay, please sit.

07:49.400 --> 07:52.659
Vice President Liao,
I'd like to propose a toast to you too.

07:53.510 --> 07:55.000
Director Fang, who is this?

07:55.000 --> 07:56.560
This is my assistant, Qian Fei.

07:56.560 --> 07:59.560
Didn't you notice
Vice President Liao doesn't drink?

08:00.800 --> 08:03.660
I'll finish it in one go.
You can drink as you please.

08:09.530 --> 08:11.850
Alright, it's the thought that counts.

08:12.030 --> 08:13.630
We have work this afternoon.

08:13.920 --> 08:14.270
Okay.

08:14.270 --> 08:16.200
I'm happy today, Director Fang.

08:16.560 --> 08:19.360
It's my first time
meeting Vice President Liao...

08:19.750 --> 08:20.810
and Director Wang,

08:21.360 --> 08:22.820
so I'm really happy today.

08:26.150 --> 08:28.420
-I'd like to propose a toast to this moment.
-No matter how happy...

08:28.420 --> 08:29.680
Let me propose a toast.

08:30.480 --> 08:32.120
I suggest
that since we have work this afternoon,

08:32.120 --> 08:33.240
we shouldn't drink so much.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.630
How about we drink tea instead of alcohol?

08:34.630 --> 08:35.270
Great.

08:35.270 --> 08:36.510
-Right?
-Good idea.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.750
Very good. Come on.

08:40.100 --> 08:41.390
Stop drinking. Stop drinking.

08:41.390 --> 08:42.590
Well...

08:42.880 --> 08:43.530
Right?

08:43.720 --> 08:46.720
-Come on.
-I wish us a pleasant cooperation

08:46.880 --> 08:49.270
in our future work.

08:49.750 --> 08:50.670
Let this cup of tea say it all.

08:50.670 --> 08:51.670
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

08:51.670 --> 08:53.130
Thanks for your hard work.

09:00.060 --> 09:01.120
Please have a seat.

09:05.430 --> 09:05.910
Mr. Li.

09:06.240 --> 09:08.430
I heard you specially visited

09:08.430 --> 09:10.240
Shan Li Fang's old headquarters
in Chengdu.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.700
You are really dedicated.

09:12.600 --> 09:14.260
I'd like to make a toast to you.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.200
Thank you, Vice President Liao.

09:17.200 --> 09:18.600
You are too polite.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.960
It's just our job.

09:25.480 --> 09:28.140
Did you gain anything
from this trip to Chengdu?

09:28.510 --> 09:29.710
We gained quite a lot.

09:33.180 --> 09:35.120
Assistant Qian, you went there too?

09:35.120 --> 09:37.330
Qian Fei, are you drunk?

09:37.390 --> 09:39.230
Why don't you go take a rest?

09:40.670 --> 09:41.810
I'm not drunk.

09:41.910 --> 09:43.170
And I don't need a rest.

09:43.670 --> 09:44.750
Vice President Liao.

09:44.750 --> 09:45.610
Director Wang.

09:45.670 --> 09:46.910
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

09:46.910 --> 09:48.680
provided our sponsor team
and audit department

09:48.680 --> 09:52.030
with many
unreasonable financial statements

09:52.150 --> 09:55.120
and concealed a lot of real data

09:55.630 --> 09:57.790
during its preparation for going public.

09:57.790 --> 10:00.390
Especially in terms of intangible assets,

10:00.390 --> 10:02.550
there were significant discrepancies.

10:02.550 --> 10:04.080
May I ask the reason?

10:05.960 --> 10:06.890
What did you say?

10:09.720 --> 10:12.150
According to the CSRC regulations
and the law,

10:12.150 --> 10:14.080
companies with severe asset fraud

10:14.410 --> 10:16.550
are not allowed
to go to the review meeting.

10:16.550 --> 10:19.680
Director Wang, it's your first time
participating in a listing project.

10:19.680 --> 10:21.140
Don't you know about this?

10:37.490 --> 10:38.390
Here is the thing.

10:38.390 --> 10:39.340
Well...

10:39.920 --> 10:41.950
If the accounts are falsified,

10:42.150 --> 10:44.020
even if the IPO is successful,

10:44.040 --> 10:45.970
you can still be held accountable.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.550
But the good thing is

10:48.080 --> 10:50.360
we found it just in time.

10:50.380 --> 10:52.000
So as long as Party A provides

10:52.080 --> 10:55.070
true and sufficient financial data,

10:55.270 --> 10:57.240
there is still plenty of time.

10:57.320 --> 10:59.630
Don't worry. Let's just enjoy our meal.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.240
Please.

11:03.390 --> 11:05.050
Let's just focus on this meal.

11:06.120 --> 11:07.200
I'm sorry.

11:07.550 --> 11:11.200
I sent Qian Fei to Chengdu
to be Mr. Li's assistant.

11:11.200 --> 11:12.960
I didn't expect that in just a few days,

11:12.960 --> 11:14.550
she would be poached by Zhizhong.

11:14.550 --> 11:18.080
You see, Mr. Li is indeed quite charming.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.270
Director Fang.

11:22.630 --> 11:23.140
Well...

11:24.320 --> 11:26.180
Director Fang, your words are...

11:26.600 --> 11:27.200
profound.

11:28.030 --> 11:29.000
Well,

11:29.000 --> 11:30.270
Vice President Liao, here's the thing.

11:30.270 --> 11:32.510
I also planned to tell you in detail

11:32.750 --> 11:35.410
what Qian Fei said
in this afternoon's meeting.

11:35.880 --> 11:38.080
This kind of problem
definitely needs to be brought up.

11:38.080 --> 11:39.610
But I didn't expect that...

11:40.150 --> 11:41.410
But it doesn't matter.

11:41.790 --> 11:43.750
Anyway, sooner or later,

11:44.150 --> 11:46.080
it has to be discussed in a meeting.

11:46.150 --> 11:47.360
Let's eat first.

11:55.350 --> 11:58.620
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]
[Conference Room]

12:18.960 --> 12:20.880
2022, 202...

12:24.790 --> 12:26.190
Come on. Let's continue.

12:38.630 --> 12:39.320
Ms. Liao.

12:40.200 --> 12:40.960
I'm sorry.

12:41.530 --> 12:42.790
I really don't know why

12:42.790 --> 12:44.520
Qian Fei is in the sponsor team.

12:44.750 --> 12:45.680
But don't worry.

12:45.780 --> 12:47.920
It's all my fault.

12:48.270 --> 12:50.070
I will do my best to make up for it.

12:50.190 --> 12:53.190
It will definitely
not affect the company's listing.

12:57.390 --> 12:58.100
Come here.

13:10.670 --> 13:11.390
I told you

13:11.630 --> 13:14.230
to call me Shiyu when no one is around.

13:14.550 --> 13:15.950
Why do you always forget?

13:24.670 --> 13:25.360
I'm tired.

13:26.080 --> 13:27.080
Give me a massage.

13:29.840 --> 13:31.170
We're at the office.

13:31.960 --> 13:33.960
There aren't even any cameras here.

13:34.270 --> 13:35.200
Who could see us?

13:41.670 --> 13:44.330
Do you think
you know this place better than I do?

13:53.960 --> 13:54.840
President Li.

13:55.110 --> 13:57.110
Alright. Thanks for your hard work.

14:03.300 --> 14:03.940
Qian Fei.

14:06.630 --> 14:08.030
Come to my office at 5:00.

14:11.120 --> 14:11.750
Boss.

14:12.150 --> 14:14.480
That old fox Fang Yun is really something.

14:14.550 --> 14:17.180
I didn't expect her
to kick the ball back to us.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.270
But we are men.

14:18.270 --> 14:19.800
We won't stoop to her level.

14:20.200 --> 14:23.150
I must say,
you did a great job at today's meeting.

14:23.390 --> 14:26.360
You were articulate and carried yourself
with confidence and composure.

14:26.360 --> 14:26.880
Boss.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.550
I'm talking to you.
What are you thinking about?

14:29.550 --> 14:30.150
Nothing.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.790
So shall we go back to Zhizhong?

14:34.080 --> 14:36.340
You go back first. I have something to do.

14:38.390 --> 14:39.850
I'll head back first then.

14:46.960 --> 14:48.720
Qian Fei, oh, Qian Fei.

14:49.510 --> 14:52.170
Why did you
lose your composure like that today?

14:53.120 --> 14:53.920
They're here.

14:54.240 --> 14:56.390
Ruohai, I can't eat seafood today.

14:56.510 --> 14:57.770
Can you taste it for me?

14:57.910 --> 14:58.430
Okay.

15:11.270 --> 15:13.790
Haven't you already forgotten about
that cheater?

15:13.790 --> 15:15.430
Is he worth you doing this?

15:16.750 --> 15:18.670
Qian Fei, wake up.

15:29.880 --> 15:30.810
Assistant Qian.

15:33.240 --> 15:35.500
Vice President Liao, what's the matter?

15:36.240 --> 15:38.550
I heard you've been doing chores
in the back office of the investment bank.

15:38.550 --> 15:40.240
Now you've joined the project team

15:40.240 --> 15:42.120
and are participating
in our Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

15:42.120 --> 15:43.080
IPO project.

15:43.270 --> 15:45.130
This shows you are quite capable.

15:47.550 --> 15:51.210
I hope you can keep your personal
and professional life separate.

15:51.550 --> 15:52.960
You really think too highly of me.

15:52.960 --> 15:54.790
I'm just using the limited time I have

15:54.790 --> 15:55.910
to do my part well.

15:56.000 --> 15:58.430
Satisfying my boss and clients
is enough for me.

15:58.430 --> 16:00.000
As for other private matters,

16:00.000 --> 16:01.200
I have no time to consider them.

16:01.200 --> 16:02.870
Miss Qian, you're highly capable,

16:02.870 --> 16:04.430
and your words are quite striking.

16:04.430 --> 16:06.030
We've seen it at the banquet.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.790
Right, Ruohai?

16:12.140 --> 16:14.600
Qian Fei and I
have known each other for years,

16:14.600 --> 16:17.060
but this is our first time
working together.

16:17.280 --> 16:19.240
But I believe that, with her ability,

16:19.240 --> 16:21.430
she can definitely handle this job well.

16:21.430 --> 16:22.120
Well then,

16:22.750 --> 16:23.750
I'll wait and see.

16:24.270 --> 16:25.340
Let's see what else about you

16:25.340 --> 16:26.530
can surprise me.

16:27.910 --> 16:29.310
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

16:29.430 --> 16:31.150
is a client we do our best to serve.

16:31.150 --> 16:32.810
Surprising you isn't my goal.

16:33.430 --> 16:35.790
Being able to help Director Wang
check for omissions

16:35.790 --> 16:38.120
and assist Shan Li Fang Hotel Group
in its smooth IPO

16:38.120 --> 16:39.000
is my honor.

16:43.550 --> 16:46.080
Then let me say a few words
on a personal note.

16:47.030 --> 16:49.410
You used to work in the back office.

16:49.630 --> 16:51.520
Now that you've finally joined
the project team,

16:51.520 --> 16:52.780
you should cherish it.

16:53.950 --> 16:56.040
Then thank you for the reminder,
Director Wang.

16:56.040 --> 16:58.370
Then let me respond
on a personal note as well.

16:58.370 --> 17:00.900
Wasting a few years
is actually not a big deal.

17:00.950 --> 17:04.119
Only by wasting opportunities
do you realize how precious they are.

17:04.119 --> 17:07.050
Encountering some scumbags
is unavoidable in life.

17:13.800 --> 17:16.230
The Marketing Department's meeting
is about to start.

17:16.230 --> 17:17.079
Let's go.

17:23.770 --> 17:24.630
Director Fang.

17:25.230 --> 17:26.760
I've found out everything.

17:27.119 --> 17:29.710
That Wang Ruohai
is Qian Fei's ex-boyfriend.

17:30.760 --> 17:33.400
He used to work at Nalan Maide Bank.

17:33.560 --> 17:35.560
The staff there all know Qian Fei.

17:36.600 --> 17:38.980
I heard they even bought a house
for marriage,

17:38.980 --> 17:40.390
booked the wedding banquet,

17:40.390 --> 17:42.720
and were just short of having the wedding.

17:46.520 --> 17:47.520
So,

17:47.800 --> 17:49.400
Wang Ruohai left Qian Fei...

17:50.470 --> 17:52.760
because of Liao Shiyu?

17:54.140 --> 17:55.140
Probably.

17:56.800 --> 17:58.360
Qian Fei used every possible means

17:58.360 --> 18:01.290
to join the project team
for Shan Li Fang Hotel Group,

18:02.040 --> 18:04.540
probably just to drag him down

18:04.670 --> 18:06.040
and bring him to ruin together.

18:06.040 --> 18:08.600
Otherwise,
why did she cause such a big mess?

18:11.670 --> 18:13.900
Is Qian Fei really that scheming?

18:19.090 --> 18:20.010
Who knows?

18:21.320 --> 18:23.760
But Qian Fei could be...

18:24.170 --> 18:25.770
a menace in our project team.

18:29.710 --> 18:32.230
I'd actually like to see where it goes.

18:39.760 --> 18:41.070
[Office]

18:53.420 --> 18:59.900
[Are you busy now?]

18:59.980 --> 19:01.650
[Dang Yu]

19:24.140 --> 19:24.640
[Dang Yu]

19:27.890 --> 19:29.880
[It's okay if you don't reply.]

19:29.880 --> 19:31.700
[I'm just here to show my presence.]

19:48.900 --> 19:54.280
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

19:58.230 --> 19:59.040
Okay.

19:59.280 --> 20:00.280
I'll leave it to you.

20:00.280 --> 20:01.360
I'll do it for you this afternoon, okay?

20:01.360 --> 20:02.290
Sure.

20:25.150 --> 20:26.900
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

20:56.030 --> 21:00.690
[Office]

21:02.670 --> 21:03.530
Director Fang.

21:09.520 --> 21:11.780
Director Fang, I'm here to apologize.

21:11.910 --> 21:13.120
I'm really sorry.

21:13.120 --> 21:14.910
You kept telling me

21:15.120 --> 21:17.040
to observe more, learn more, speak less,

21:17.040 --> 21:18.840
and preferably not speak at all.

21:18.840 --> 21:20.180
But this time, I still...

21:20.180 --> 21:21.430
You're almost 30, right?

21:21.430 --> 21:23.630
How are you not even as good as an intern?

21:24.120 --> 21:26.040
You've been working for so many years.

21:26.040 --> 21:27.520
Yet you still can't control yourself.

21:27.520 --> 21:29.760
I'm sorry. I was really too impulsive

21:29.760 --> 21:30.520
and reckless this time.

21:30.520 --> 21:31.520
It caused

21:31.520 --> 21:32.470
such a bad impact on you and the company

21:32.470 --> 21:34.320
and affected everyone's work.

21:34.390 --> 21:36.960
I am willing to make
a public self-criticism.

21:37.360 --> 21:38.760
I hope you can forgive me.

21:38.990 --> 21:40.310
Many things

21:40.800 --> 21:42.600
can't be solved just by a self-criticism.

21:42.600 --> 21:44.190
Li Yifei was quite kind today.

21:44.190 --> 21:45.430
He didn't kick us when we were down.

21:45.430 --> 21:47.280
Otherwise, He Jing

21:47.630 --> 21:49.370
would have been destroyed by you alone.

21:49.370 --> 21:51.230
We might have been kicked out
of the project team.

21:51.230 --> 21:52.160
Do you know that?

21:52.230 --> 21:54.760
Do you think a self-criticism
can solve this?

21:55.190 --> 21:57.190
I know how serious
my mistake is this time.

21:57.190 --> 21:58.040
But I still hope

21:58.040 --> 21:59.560
you can give me one last chance.

21:59.560 --> 22:01.280
You know
that to return to He Jing this time,

22:01.280 --> 22:03.450
I put in so much effort and hard work.

22:04.280 --> 22:06.190
Don't talk to me about your effort.

22:06.190 --> 22:07.430
Who here didn't put in a lot of effort?

22:07.430 --> 22:09.360
To win the Shan Li Fang project,

22:09.520 --> 22:11.880
do you know how many all-nighters
the whole team pulled

22:11.880 --> 22:13.360
and how much overtime we worked?

22:13.360 --> 22:15.990
Is there anyone in investment banking
who doesn't put in the effort?

22:15.990 --> 22:17.840
Is there anyone who puts in less?

22:18.230 --> 22:19.910
You think your little bit of effort
is a big deal?

22:19.910 --> 22:21.050
You're far from it!

22:21.800 --> 22:23.480
How can I use someone like you?

22:24.230 --> 22:25.360
Director Fang, I...

22:28.360 --> 22:28.950
Mr. Li.

22:29.520 --> 22:30.560
Did I come at a bad time?

22:30.560 --> 22:30.990
No, not at all.

22:30.990 --> 22:32.150
Come in, Mr. Li.

22:32.150 --> 22:33.010
Director Fang.

22:33.910 --> 22:34.730
I brought you some

22:34.730 --> 22:36.710
apples grown by my relatives back home.

22:36.710 --> 22:37.280
They are organic.

22:37.280 --> 22:37.920
Thank you.

22:37.940 --> 22:39.080
That's very thoughtful of you.

22:39.080 --> 22:39.800
Please, have a seat.

22:39.800 --> 22:40.010
Okay.

22:40.010 --> 22:40.810
You can go now.

22:41.010 --> 22:42.140
It's fine, Qian Fei.

22:43.040 --> 22:44.970
Why don't you stay here and listen?

22:49.520 --> 22:50.380
Director Fang.

22:51.910 --> 22:52.840
To be honest,

22:53.800 --> 22:56.060
I've run into some difficulties lately.

22:56.230 --> 22:57.760
What kind of difficulties?

22:58.120 --> 22:59.360
You might laugh at me,

22:59.380 --> 23:00.950
but it's my assistant, Zhao De.

23:00.950 --> 23:02.060
You remember him, right?

23:02.060 --> 23:04.590
He has a lot on his plate
at Zhizhong right now.

23:04.630 --> 23:06.120
He's completely overwhelmed

23:06.120 --> 23:08.050
and has no time for things on my end.

23:08.230 --> 23:10.040
Just when we're short-handed,

23:10.060 --> 23:11.590
he pulled a stunt like this.

23:12.360 --> 23:13.250
I really...

23:13.800 --> 23:15.400
Sometimes I really envy you.

23:15.950 --> 23:17.560
Surrounded by a crowd of stu—

23:17.950 --> 23:19.600
No, you have a lot of talents.

23:19.650 --> 23:21.250
Every single one is capable.

23:21.760 --> 23:23.470
When I think about my current situation,

23:23.470 --> 23:24.470
I just feel...

23:24.560 --> 23:25.860
upset. I really do.

23:26.030 --> 23:27.290
I really envy you.

23:28.040 --> 23:30.040
I see. You're short-handed, right?

23:30.630 --> 23:32.880
Why didn't you ask Zhizhong
to give you more staff?

23:32.880 --> 23:33.880
I wish I could.

23:34.950 --> 23:36.670
Since this collaboration with you,

23:36.670 --> 23:38.870
in my eyes, those people in Zhizhong...

23:40.110 --> 23:41.760
It's too hard. It really is.

23:47.190 --> 23:48.560
Do you think

23:50.040 --> 23:52.990
there's anyone at He Jing available…

23:53.600 --> 23:54.930
I mean, who can help you?

23:55.880 --> 23:57.110
I wouldn't dare

23:57.360 --> 23:58.430
to ask you for people

23:58.430 --> 23:59.150
like Cui and Dai Xi.

23:59.150 --> 24:00.630
They are indeed very capable.

24:00.630 --> 24:03.290
Because I just want to find
a special assistant.

24:03.600 --> 24:05.470
It would be a waste of their talents.

24:05.470 --> 24:05.950
Right?

24:06.910 --> 24:08.240
I think someone like...

24:08.430 --> 24:08.990
well...

24:09.670 --> 24:10.970
someone like Qian Fei,

24:13.030 --> 24:14.490
who is averagely capable,

24:14.880 --> 24:15.940
as an assistant...

24:15.950 --> 24:16.470
would be fine.

24:16.470 --> 24:18.190
So if it's convenient for you,

24:18.360 --> 24:19.430
could we let her be my special assistant

24:19.430 --> 24:20.860
during our cooperation?

24:21.120 --> 24:22.120
What do you think?

24:55.820 --> 24:59.360
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

24:55.950 --> 24:56.560
Hello.

24:58.190 --> 24:59.620
Hello, I'm the security guard
of this building.

24:59.620 --> 25:01.080
Have you been on duty here

25:01.080 --> 25:02.600
since 3:30 p.m.?

25:02.880 --> 25:04.120
Yes. What's wrong?

25:04.630 --> 25:05.630
Here's the thing.

25:05.630 --> 25:07.630
Take a look. Do you know this person?

25:09.320 --> 25:10.830
Why did he follow me here?

25:11.710 --> 25:12.910
He's still in the lobby.

25:12.910 --> 25:13.840
If you feel

25:13.840 --> 25:15.640
he poses a threat to your safety,

25:15.670 --> 25:18.270
you can leave
through the back door after work.

25:18.430 --> 25:19.800
Okay. Thank you.

25:19.800 --> 25:21.060
Okay. You're welcome.

25:21.840 --> 25:25.900
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

25:27.360 --> 25:29.190
He doesn't need a special assistant.

25:29.190 --> 25:30.920
He just wants me to run errands.

25:31.470 --> 25:32.880
Pour-over coffee?

25:33.360 --> 25:34.320
So pretentious.

25:56.530 --> 26:02.610
♪ Whenever I look up ♪

26:03.620 --> 26:09.030
♪ I ran into your eyes ♪

26:11.040 --> 26:16.920
♪ Trying to catch that pleasant light ♪

26:18.190 --> 26:24.220
♪ To embrace that fleeting moment
of happiness ♪

26:25.960 --> 26:32.100
♪ Sometimes I cry,
and sometimes I'm happy ♪

26:33.830 --> 26:39.480
♪ Sometimes I feel
I've captured the sweetness ♪

26:41.200 --> 26:47.080
♪ Sometimes, I run,
and sometimes, I fall ♪

26:48.260 --> 26:54.430
♪ Sometimes I feel
that having you is the best thing ♪

26:55.150 --> 26:56.630
The person who once tied my shoelaces

26:56.330 --> 27:01.530
♪ I've never loved anyone
like I love you ♪

26:57.760 --> 26:59.490
can also do it for someone else.

27:01.280 --> 27:02.320
Qian Fei,

27:02.920 --> 27:09.500
♪ Without any hesitation ♪

27:03.880 --> 27:05.280
this is reality.

27:09.680 --> 27:11.810
A change of relationship
reveals a person's true colors.

27:10.650 --> 27:16.850
♪ I've never been loved like you love me ♪

27:13.430 --> 27:15.830
This person
used to be very important to me,

27:16.990 --> 27:18.880
but from now on,

27:18.340 --> 27:24.280
♪ In short, I'll wait for my love ♪

27:19.760 --> 27:21.290
he has nothing to do with me.

27:24.770 --> 27:29.350
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]
[Director's Office]

27:26.320 --> 27:31.830
♪ I've never seen a bright sea like you ♪

27:33.210 --> 27:39.660
♪ Every minute is colorful ♪

27:41.750 --> 27:47.100
♪ I've never experienced
such a warm love as yours ♪

27:47.960 --> 27:57.590
♪ In short, I won't let go of my hand ♪

28:25.190 --> 28:27.520
The rain keeps falling.

28:28.950 --> 28:31.600
The vibe doesn't feel very pleasant.

28:33.470 --> 28:34.760
It really doesn't.

28:37.760 --> 28:39.560
Did you already know about this?

28:43.360 --> 28:45.090
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

28:45.390 --> 28:47.120
I was protecting you, okay?

28:47.670 --> 28:48.480
Well,

28:49.150 --> 28:50.310
if you had known earlier

28:50.310 --> 28:52.710
that Wang Ruohai
was the CFO of Shan Li Fang,

28:52.840 --> 28:54.760
would you have tried so hard
to return to He Jing

28:54.760 --> 28:56.220
and join the project team?

28:56.390 --> 28:56.990
Would you?

29:10.670 --> 29:11.770
Let me tell you.

29:13.770 --> 29:16.570
I've been in investment banking
for so many years.

29:17.040 --> 29:18.900
I've seen my fair share of people.

29:20.110 --> 29:23.370
I genuinely think you have what it takes
for this industry.

29:24.730 --> 29:26.360
I just cherish talent.

29:27.190 --> 29:29.910
I don't want to see you

29:29.910 --> 29:31.430
lose an important job opportunity

29:31.430 --> 29:33.520
and a turning point in your life

29:33.540 --> 29:35.270
over such insignificant love.

29:37.540 --> 29:40.270
And as your master,
let me give you another truth.

29:42.470 --> 29:44.990
Don't value love above everything else.

29:45.080 --> 29:47.450
In this world, only work

29:47.760 --> 29:50.020
will not betray your effort and passion.

29:52.150 --> 29:54.040
I've already moved on.

29:56.460 --> 29:59.300
And he has someone new by his side now.

29:59.910 --> 30:01.110
I respect his choice.

30:03.990 --> 30:05.780
At least I know

30:06.120 --> 30:08.250
I once loved someone with all my heart.

30:08.800 --> 30:09.700
That's enough.

30:11.520 --> 30:12.900
Are you a woodpecker?

30:13.390 --> 30:14.520
You're so stubborn.

30:15.190 --> 30:16.360
If you had really moved on,

30:16.360 --> 30:17.320
in the banquet hall today,

30:17.320 --> 30:18.390
you wouldn't have so aggressively

30:18.390 --> 30:20.360
pointed out
Shan Li Fang's financial problems.

30:20.360 --> 30:20.910
Well...

30:21.440 --> 30:22.430
How was I supposed to know

30:22.430 --> 30:24.220
I'd run into the two of them?

30:24.950 --> 30:26.320
I have moved on.

30:26.320 --> 30:27.760
But seeing them together,

30:27.760 --> 30:29.880
I just got so angry all of a sudden.

30:30.760 --> 30:32.270
I couldn't think that much.

30:32.270 --> 30:33.650
It's normal.

30:35.710 --> 30:38.520
I could only turn my anger into courage

30:38.880 --> 30:40.040
to say it all out.

30:44.950 --> 30:45.640
That's why

30:46.630 --> 30:48.950
whenever I see you not thinking clearly,

30:48.950 --> 30:50.030
I feel glad

30:50.760 --> 30:53.090
that my parents didn't make me too stupid.

30:54.520 --> 30:55.190
Seriously.

30:55.360 --> 30:57.170
You went against Director Fang's will

30:57.170 --> 30:58.920
in front of so many people today.

30:58.920 --> 31:01.390
She could have easily fired you.

31:03.230 --> 31:05.360
You worked so hard
to get into the project team.

31:05.360 --> 31:06.290
What?

31:06.560 --> 31:08.160
You just want a one-day tour?

31:13.600 --> 31:15.330
Hurry up and thank your master.

31:15.600 --> 31:17.530
You should thank me for saving you.

31:17.840 --> 31:18.760
Alright.

31:19.230 --> 31:19.760
Thank...

31:21.910 --> 31:22.800
Thank you.

31:24.600 --> 31:25.730
That's more like it.

31:26.840 --> 31:28.840
And also, from today on,

31:28.840 --> 31:31.430
you're my special assistant.

31:34.760 --> 31:35.560
From now on,

31:36.470 --> 31:37.800
you have to listen to me.

31:40.150 --> 31:41.500
Only at the company.

31:41.600 --> 31:42.600
Only for work.

31:42.630 --> 31:44.760
I'm still your master even in private.

31:45.280 --> 31:47.140
Once a teacher, always a teacher.

31:47.390 --> 31:48.840
You've called me master for so many days.

31:48.840 --> 31:50.560
How could I just leave you alone?

31:50.560 --> 31:51.630
In your dreams.

31:53.040 --> 31:54.470
Are you trying to make me
your 24/7 servant?

31:54.470 --> 31:55.840
Don't say that about me.

31:56.760 --> 31:58.080
You read my mind.

32:00.520 --> 32:01.670
You are overthinking it.

32:01.670 --> 32:03.710
You think
because you're my temporary boss now,

32:03.710 --> 32:05.310
I wouldn't dare kick you out?

32:06.280 --> 32:08.840
Whether I move out or not
depends on the contract, right?

32:08.840 --> 32:11.520
Work is work, and sharing an apartment
is a separate matter.

32:11.520 --> 32:13.360
We shouldn't mix them up.

32:14.280 --> 32:15.600
You'd better not.

32:16.190 --> 32:17.520
You never

32:17.520 --> 32:18.710
stop talking.

32:21.280 --> 32:23.390
It doesn't hurt to listen, you know?

32:24.630 --> 32:25.190
Fine.

32:25.600 --> 32:27.760
I wasted these apples on you today.

32:29.350 --> 32:31.480
Where did you get these apples anyway?

32:32.710 --> 32:34.880
I bought them
at the supermarket downstairs.

32:34.880 --> 32:36.060
I knew it.

32:36.670 --> 32:38.820
But they're really organic.

32:38.910 --> 32:39.850
I'm serious.

32:40.360 --> 32:41.150
Fine.

32:42.560 --> 32:43.280
Farewell.

32:43.990 --> 32:45.360
"Farewell"?

32:46.360 --> 32:47.530
So dramatic.

32:48.330 --> 32:49.260
So childish.

33:36.910 --> 33:37.870
So?

33:38.560 --> 33:40.820
Have you figured out how to tell Qian Fei?

33:40.880 --> 33:43.140
I have to tell her sooner or later anyway.

33:43.230 --> 33:45.440
Besides, she went to Shan Li Fang
for due diligence today.

33:45.440 --> 33:47.880
I think she
must have seen Wang Ruohai already.

33:47.880 --> 33:49.540
And I believe she has moved on.

34:00.320 --> 34:01.360
You ordered so much?

34:01.360 --> 34:02.880
-Have a seat.
-Why did you get caught in the rain?

34:02.880 --> 34:04.430
Hurry up and dry off.

34:06.030 --> 34:07.010
I'm starving.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.469
I knew you'd be hungry.

34:08.469 --> 34:11.130
Were you busy
on your first day of due diligence?

34:12.590 --> 34:13.590
It's a long story.

34:15.590 --> 34:17.230
Can I eat first?

34:17.320 --> 34:18.580
-Okay. Eat up.
-Eat up.

34:24.389 --> 34:26.719
Why are you suddenly
treating me to a meal?

34:27.800 --> 34:30.469
Just dropping by to show off
how much we love each other.

34:30.469 --> 34:31.739
So dramatic.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.909
You can still laugh?

34:36.719 --> 34:37.199
Fei.

34:38.389 --> 34:40.870
Actually, Jingjing and I are here

34:40.889 --> 34:42.090
to apologize.

34:43.670 --> 34:44.929
What are you afraid of?

34:45.469 --> 34:47.670
Whatever happens, I've got your back.

34:47.909 --> 34:48.989
Just say it.

34:48.989 --> 34:50.199
Don't think that just because
Qian Fei didn't mention it,

34:50.199 --> 34:52.730
-you can get away with it.
-Alright, alright.

34:53.909 --> 34:56.280
Did you see...

34:56.760 --> 34:57.960
you-know-who today?

35:07.320 --> 35:09.390
You two already knew
Wang Ruohai went to Shan Li Fang,

35:09.390 --> 35:10.030
didn't you?

35:10.030 --> 35:12.200
Shan Li Fang is the parent company
of Xinxin Vision,

35:12.200 --> 35:14.840
and Wang Ruohai has just
been appointed CFO there.

35:14.840 --> 35:16.590
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

35:17.030 --> 35:18.760
It was for your career.

35:18.780 --> 35:20.990
What if you knew that jerk
joined Shan Li Fang

35:20.990 --> 35:22.430
and you stopped trying hard

35:22.430 --> 35:24.430
to get into Fang Yun's project team?

35:24.640 --> 35:26.910
I was doing it for your own good.

35:27.320 --> 35:29.650
Don't you understand my good intentions?

35:42.040 --> 35:44.690
How could I not understand that,
silly girl?

35:46.430 --> 35:48.430
It's a good thing you didn't tell me.

35:48.550 --> 35:49.280
Otherwise,

35:49.280 --> 35:51.910
I wouldn't have tried so hard
to get into that company.

35:51.910 --> 35:53.620
You know me best.

35:53.950 --> 35:54.590
See?

35:55.510 --> 35:57.050
Men mean nothing.

35:57.920 --> 35:59.410
Here's to our chemistry.

35:59.550 --> 36:00.290
Cheers.

36:02.800 --> 36:05.860
Never try to guess
what women are thinking. Seriously.

36:06.010 --> 36:07.560
So you two treated me to dinner today

36:07.560 --> 36:08.970
just for this?

36:10.680 --> 36:11.840
That's totally unnecessary.

36:11.840 --> 36:13.160
Jingjing and I are very close.

36:13.160 --> 36:15.090
We are not like those fake friends.

36:15.800 --> 36:16.400
Alright.

36:16.680 --> 36:17.800
Then let's split the bill today.

36:17.800 --> 36:18.590
No way.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.340
I never said I forgive you.

36:21.390 --> 36:22.510
It has to be on you.

36:22.680 --> 36:23.240
Alright.

36:24.320 --> 36:27.150
Well... did Liao Shiyu and Wang Ruohai

36:27.910 --> 36:29.640
make things difficult for you?

36:29.720 --> 36:31.690
Now that they are your clients,

36:31.720 --> 36:32.950
I'm a bit worried.

36:34.840 --> 36:36.760
Like you said, they are my clients.

36:36.760 --> 36:38.880
Clients are the kings.

36:39.240 --> 36:42.070
They won't pick on a nobody like me.

36:42.160 --> 36:43.070
Don't worry.

36:44.720 --> 36:45.530
Alright then.

36:46.320 --> 36:48.080
If this woman, because of this,

36:48.110 --> 36:50.040
gives you a hard time and fires you,

36:50.800 --> 36:52.200
you have nothing to fear.

36:52.280 --> 36:53.640
After we get married,

36:53.760 --> 36:56.550
my husband will support me,
and I will support you.

36:56.550 --> 36:59.480
"My husband will support me,
and I will support you."

36:59.910 --> 37:00.430
Wait.

37:00.880 --> 37:01.880
No, the first sentence.

37:01.880 --> 37:03.080
I can support you too.

37:05.030 --> 37:05.680
No.

37:07.360 --> 37:08.640
After we get married?

37:08.640 --> 37:09.770
What does that mean?

37:11.160 --> 37:11.910
It means...

37:13.990 --> 37:15.700
Yao Jingjing!

37:16.550 --> 37:18.200
You guys are getting married?

37:18.200 --> 37:19.760
Didn't I tell you at the very beginning

37:19.760 --> 37:21.350
that we're here
to show off our love today?

37:21.350 --> 37:22.160
Come on!

37:22.320 --> 37:23.680
When did you propose?

37:26.680 --> 37:28.690
Don't even mention it.

37:29.030 --> 37:30.070
You know what? That day,

37:30.070 --> 37:31.030
I had just bought the ring

37:31.030 --> 37:32.760
and hadn't set up the proposal scene yet.

37:32.760 --> 37:33.800
I was taking a shower,

37:33.800 --> 37:35.060
and she found the ring.

37:35.200 --> 37:36.680
Let me tell you how it went down.

37:36.680 --> 37:38.760
If I hadn't proposed to her right there,

37:38.760 --> 37:39.910
she would have forced me to hand over

37:39.910 --> 37:41.270
my imaginary mistress.

37:42.070 --> 37:44.360
Then he knelt on the ground and proposed,

37:44.360 --> 37:45.950
wearing a bathrobe and barefoot.

37:45.950 --> 37:47.680
It was not romantic at all.

37:48.360 --> 37:50.850
Not bad, guys.

37:50.880 --> 37:52.400
Too bad I wasn't there.

37:53.800 --> 37:55.280
But who cares if it's romantic?

37:55.280 --> 37:55.750
Look.

37:55.840 --> 37:56.880
You are wearing a big ring.

37:56.880 --> 37:58.540
And you say it's not romantic?

37:59.360 --> 38:01.150
I never thought I'd see the day

38:01.430 --> 38:03.910
when our Jingjing
would actually be won over by someone.

38:03.910 --> 38:05.780
Who was it that kept telling me

38:06.280 --> 38:08.720
all those downsides
of getting married early?

38:08.720 --> 38:09.580
Now look at you.

38:10.950 --> 38:12.610
I wanted to get married,

38:12.680 --> 38:14.160
but now I don't even have a guy.

38:14.160 --> 38:14.990
But you,

38:14.990 --> 38:17.430
your career and love life
are both successful.

38:17.430 --> 38:18.510
Congratulations.

38:19.390 --> 38:19.910
Come on.

38:21.110 --> 38:22.590
Let me offer you a toast.

38:22.590 --> 38:23.910
You tamed a demoness.

38:24.030 --> 38:25.640
You really did a great service
to the people.

38:25.640 --> 38:26.880
How am I a demoness?

38:26.880 --> 38:28.240
Why would you say that about me?

38:28.240 --> 38:29.530
We are at least

38:29.720 --> 38:31.180
a strong alliance, right?

38:34.550 --> 38:37.770
Look, Shan Li Fang is about to go public.

38:37.990 --> 38:39.950
Then Xinxin Vision's options
in Shan Li Fang

38:39.950 --> 38:40.840
can be cashed out.

38:40.840 --> 38:42.360
Then we'd achieve financial freedom

38:42.360 --> 38:43.720
and have no money worries anymore.

38:43.720 --> 38:45.060
So why not

38:45.430 --> 38:47.020
take this chance to get married

38:47.020 --> 38:48.170
and have a kid?

38:49.240 --> 38:51.370
How many kids are you planning to have?

38:52.070 --> 38:53.950
We'll just let nature take its course.

38:53.950 --> 38:55.550
Besides, even if we do get married,

38:55.550 --> 38:57.810
we'll still keep our current lifestyle.

38:57.990 --> 38:59.480
Even if we have a kid,

38:59.550 --> 39:02.280
we'll raise them together
and share the responsibilities.

39:02.280 --> 39:02.910
Right?

39:02.950 --> 39:03.720
Absolutely.

39:27.760 --> 39:29.490
The landlady won't let me down.

39:53.640 --> 39:56.600
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

39:57.580 --> 40:00.780
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

40:01.830 --> 40:03.250
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

40:04.020 --> 40:05.480
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

40:05.710 --> 40:07.650
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

40:08.340 --> 40:09.900
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

40:10.700 --> 40:14.160
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

40:15.220 --> 40:18.390
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

40:19.350 --> 40:20.650
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

40:21.280 --> 40:22.720
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

40:23.470 --> 40:25.360
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

40:26.070 --> 40:27.430
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

40:28.980 --> 40:31.290
Didn't you get off work early,
Assistant Qian?

40:31.290 --> 40:32.400
Where are you?

40:33.280 --> 40:36.140
I'm off work,
so Assistant Qian won't be around you.

40:36.590 --> 40:38.530
I noticed you hadn't come back.

40:38.560 --> 40:40.330
I was afraid you hadn't had dinner,

40:40.330 --> 40:41.930
so I couldn't help but worry.

40:42.000 --> 40:43.660
-If you want to eat the food in the fridge,
-I need to go to the toilet.

40:43.660 --> 40:44.990
stop beating around the bush.

40:44.990 --> 40:47.250
You know how to use the microwave, right?

41:15.160 --> 41:15.800
Lu Ze.

41:16.430 --> 41:19.060
You must treat our Jingjing well
in the future.

41:19.680 --> 41:20.510
That's for sure.

41:20.510 --> 41:22.080
Our Jingjing is a good girl.

41:22.110 --> 41:23.590
Although she can be a bit willful
sometimes,

41:23.590 --> 41:24.590
it's because her family

41:24.590 --> 41:26.920
didn't give her enough sense of security.

41:27.990 --> 41:31.320
You must be very tolerant of her
in this regard in the future.

41:31.430 --> 41:33.320
The biggest advantage of marrying me

41:33.320 --> 41:35.990
is that I'm okay
with all her strengths and weaknesses,

41:35.990 --> 41:38.250
as well as her fussiness and insecurity.

41:38.280 --> 41:39.550
What a humblebrag.

41:40.430 --> 41:41.030
By the way,

41:41.030 --> 41:43.430
the IPO preparations
for Shan Li Fang have started.

41:43.430 --> 41:45.240
We will simultaneously analyze

41:45.240 --> 41:46.360
the financial status
of all Shan Li Fang subsidiaries,

41:46.360 --> 41:48.440
including yours.

41:48.880 --> 41:49.490
Is that so?

41:50.640 --> 41:52.040
I don't know the details.

41:52.320 --> 41:54.030
I thought only after a successful IPO

41:54.030 --> 41:55.890
would someone come supervise us.

41:56.390 --> 41:57.590
It has already begun.

41:57.840 --> 41:59.240
If I remember correctly,

41:59.280 --> 42:00.950
I should have seen

42:00.950 --> 42:02.510
your company's statements.

42:02.510 --> 42:04.240
The accounts didn't look good.

42:05.030 --> 42:07.890
It seems a few recent financing rounds
also failed.

42:08.200 --> 42:10.860
It's true.
The company is losing money now.

42:10.950 --> 42:12.200
But it's a startup in its early stage.

42:12.200 --> 42:13.550
The product isn't commercialized yet.

42:13.550 --> 42:14.990
Plus the continuous investment,

42:14.990 --> 42:16.320
this is bound to happen.

42:16.510 --> 42:17.910
You've been losing money
for 3 consecutive years,

42:17.910 --> 42:19.240
yet Shan Li Fang still keeps you

42:19.240 --> 42:20.950
on board during its IPO process.

42:20.950 --> 42:21.760
It shows that

42:22.320 --> 42:23.840
they value you quite a bit.

42:24.800 --> 42:27.110
They say capital is short-sighted,

42:27.470 --> 42:28.720
but I feel quite lucky

42:29.070 --> 42:30.510
to have encountered Shan Li Fang.

42:30.510 --> 42:31.430
Chairman Liao is a good man.

42:31.430 --> 42:32.720
But I still think...

42:33.760 --> 42:34.680
You're back?

42:35.760 --> 42:37.430
Look how happy you are.

42:38.510 --> 42:41.200
You two must

42:41.200 --> 42:42.380
be happy forever.

42:44.030 --> 42:45.430
Congratulations again.

42:45.640 --> 42:46.700
-Cheers.
-Come on.

42:47.950 --> 42:48.720
Cheers.

42:51.930 --> 42:53.650
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:55.490 --> 42:56.280
Oh mama!

42:57.880 --> 42:58.940
What are you doing?

42:59.030 --> 43:01.240
Putting on some spooky act
and taking advantage of me?

43:01.240 --> 43:02.010
I heard

43:02.590 --> 43:04.550
your joint sponsor team is a mess,

43:04.610 --> 43:06.840
and you still haven't found a solution.

43:07.130 --> 43:08.130
Here's the thing.

43:08.190 --> 43:10.130
I'll definitely come up with a plan
as soon as possible.

43:10.130 --> 43:11.800
I'm just waiting for your word.

43:11.800 --> 43:12.980
Do you know why Director Fang

43:12.980 --> 43:14.780
is giving you the cold shoulder?

43:14.820 --> 43:17.620
Whether Director Fang
accepts my apology or not,

43:18.160 --> 43:19.620
I'm mentally prepared.
